=== 4. the crossover, closed form (sympy)
  N binds iff N_CI < P_CI*h_N/h_P
  P = 1040 ppm -> N crossover 2400 ppm
  P =  920 ppm -> N crossover 2123 ppm
  P = 1080 ppm -> N crossover 2492 ppm
  P =  985 ppm -> N crossover 2273 ppm
  P =  989 ppm -> N crossover 2282 ppm
